  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Amazing_Xray/BH_AX_Header.webp\" alt=\"Banner Header\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftinyurl.com%252famy67484\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Amazing_Xray/BH_AX_PromoCard.webp\" alt=\"Banner BisectHosting\"></a> <img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Amazing_Xray/BH_AX_Overview.webp\" alt=\"Banner Overview\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>Amazing Xray</strong> 是一款基於 X 光的 Minecraft 整合包。相容於所有原版伺服器，並已針對含光影進行完全最佳化。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/N8tUm6N4Qc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"discord-plural\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Kesselspacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/social/youtube-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"youtube-plural\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fkesselot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/donate/kofi-singular-alt_vector.svg\" alt=\"kofi-singular-alt\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftinyurl.com%252famy67484\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/documentation/website_vector.svg\" alt=\"website\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h3>[✔️] G - X 光設定</h3>\n<h3>[✔️] # - 啟用/停用 X 光</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/N8tUm6N4Qc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Amazing_Xray/BH_AX_Discord.webp\" alt=\"Banner Discord\"></a></p>\n<h3>整合包注意事項</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>如果您是 YouTube 創作者或內容創作者並使用本整合包，請在描述中附上連結回此頁面，以便他人知道您正在使用的整合包。</strong></li>\n<li><strong>禁止在 CurseForge 上重新上傳本整合包或任何修改版本，此規定亦包含重新分發至任何其他網站。</strong>（<em>除非獲得本人明確許可</em>）</li>\n</ul>",
